  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="article reveal">
        <nav class="breadcrumb"><a href="index.html">Home</a> / <a href="index.html#experiences">Off beat escapes</a> / Big Game Fishing in Lamu</nav>
        <p class="article__lead">Something different for the weekend, head to the Lamu archipelago for the deep blue thrill of big game fishing, then come back to barefoot Swahili luxury at The Majlis. Chase sailfish, tuna and dorado by day; dhow sails, sundowners and the slow rhythm of the islands by night.</p>
        <p>An insider's coast escape for those already in East Africa, with smooth fly in logistics. Catch and release is encouraged; your catch can be cooked for dinner.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--cream">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__head reveal"><p class="eyebrow">Day by day</p><h2 class="section__title">Your escape</h2></div>
      <div class="days">
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Fri</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Fly to Lamu &amp; The Majlis</h3><p>A flight to Manda, then a short boat hop to The Majlis on the waterfront. Settle in, then a sunset dhow sail across the channel with a cold drink in hand.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> The Majlis, Lamu · <b>Meals:</b> Dinner</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Sat</div><div class="day__body"><h3>A day on the deep blue</h3><p>An early start aboard a fully equipped game fishing boat with a seasoned skipper, sailfish, yellowfin tuna, dorado and trevally are all on the cards. Lunch on the water, then back to a fresh seafood feast as the sun drops.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> The Majlis, Lamu · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Sun</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Stone Town &amp; fly home</h3><p>A gentle morning, a guided wander through Lamu's UNESCO old town, or one more swim, then the boat and flight home.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Meals:</b> Breakfast</p></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

