        </ul>
        <p style="margin-top:1.2rem;color:var(--ink-soft)">From <strong>$1,650 per person sharing</strong>; <strong>resident rates available</strong>. The peak billfish season runs roughly November to March. Easily extended for more days on the water or the beach.</p>
